abstract: >
  PerinatalKG is an OWL 2 knowledge graph integrating Brazilian
  population-level birth records (SINASC) with gridded climate data
  (BR-DWGD) and municipal socioeconomic indicators (IBGE) under a
  formal ontology aligned with BFO and mapped to SNOMED-CT, ICD-10,
  and LOINC. SIM neonatal mortality data were used for linkage
  validation only and are not integrated into the knowledge graph.
  Proof-of-concept: Goias state (2015-2024), 934,806 births,
  13,334,157 RDF triples, Apache Jena Fuseki 6.0.0.
